<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Oct 29.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* DSP Communications Inc said it would acquire Proxim Inc in a deal worth $400 million. It said the new company would have $1.7 billion in market capitalization. DSP shares closed at 52-3/8 on Monday and Proxim closed at 18-45/64.</p>
<p>* Shares of American Express Co fell 1/4 to 46 in London overnight after the company reported earnings in line with expectations following Monday's stock market close.  </p>
<p>* Park National Corp said it was in a merger pact with First Knox Banc Corp worth $114.3 million. Park National closed at 48-7/8. First Knox closed at 29.</p>
